## Import
You can import a workspace private endpoint resource using the project ID and the VPC endpoint id, separated by slashes, e.g.

```
$ terraform import mongodbatlas_stream_workspace_private_endpoint.test "6117ac2fe2a3d04ed27a9871/vpce-0abc123def4567890"
```

For more information see: [MongoDB Atlas API - Streams](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/group/endpoint-streams) Documentation.
